      "cooked": "<p>With the forum migrating today and us poor Megalopolis citizens being kicked out into the cold for the duration, how about a nice rousing game to keep us warm while we huddle around the empty oil barrel?</p>\n<p>Who can post closest to when they take down the forum and have their post survive when it comes back up again?</p>\n<p>I’ll start!</p>\n<p>Anybody know where we get our fingerless gloves from? They seem to be standard for hobos</p>",
